{"seq":3,"slug":"inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole","title":"容斥与鸽巢原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inclusion-exclusion","title":"容斥原理与错位排列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/inclusion-exclusion","wordCount":2336,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"pigeonhole-ramsey","title":"鸽巢原理与 Ramsey 理论入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/pigeonhole-ramsey","wordCount":2609,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"sieve-methods-probability","title":"筛法与组合概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/sieve-methods-probability","wordCount":2696,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"容斥与鸽巢原理-简介\">容斥与鸽巢原理 简介</h1><p>容斥原理和鸽巢原理代表组合数学中两种截然不同但同样重要的思维范式。容斥原理通过&quot;先多算再减去重复&quot;的策略精确计数满足复杂条件的对象数目；鸽巢原理则通过简洁的存在性论证揭示离散结构中不可避免的规律性。两者共同构成了解决困难组合问题的核心武器库。</p>\n<p>本章包含以下三篇文档：</p>\n<p><strong>容斥原理与错位排列</strong>从集合的容斥公式出发，给出一般化表述和莫比乌斯反演的联系，然后以错位排列（derangement）为核心应用展示容斥原理的计算流程，并拓展到欧拉函数、素数筛法等数论应用。</p>\n<p><strong>鸽巢原理与 Ramsey 理论入门</strong>从简单鸽巢原理出发，逐步推广到广义鸽巢原理和无穷版本，然后引入 Ramsey 定理作为&quot;高阶鸽巢原理&quot;，讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(3,3)=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 等小 Ramsey 数的证明，以及 Ramsey 理论在数论和几何中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>筛法与组合概率</strong>将容斥原理和鸽巢原理综合应用于概率计数，介绍 Bonferroni 不等式作为容斥的近似工具，讨论随机排列中的固定点分布、生日问题的精确分析，以及概率方法在组合存在性证明中的威力（Lovász Local Lemma 初步）。</p>\n<p>学习建议：容斥原理的关键在于正确识别&quot;坏性质&quot;并计算各交集的大小，建议从简单的二性质容斥开始逐步增加复杂度。鸽巢原理的挑战在于构造合适的&quot;鸽子&quot;与&quot;笼子&quot;的对应关系，需要创造性思维。第三篇综合文档适合在前两篇扎实掌握后阅读。</p>\n"}